<title>USA: TABLE - Forensic Tech Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Forensic Tech Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>ANNAPOLIS, Md. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q2		   Six Months</p>
<p>				1997	 1996	1997	  1996</p>
<p> Revenues		  $9,487    $8,008   $19,011     $14,974</p>
<p> Net			    710	 651     1,350	   955</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share</p>
<p>  assuming full dilution 0.15	0.17	0.29	  0.27</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>    outstanding     4,718,262 4,006,324 4,714,560   3,637,592</p>
<p>	 (in thousands of dollars, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Forensic Technologies International Corp said the decrease in earnings per share reflected a 17.8 percent increase in shares outstanding due to May 1996 initial public offering.</p>
</text>
